						<initial/>
						<documentation value="Public companies listed on a stock exchange and subject to disclosure requirements (either by stock exchange&#xA; rules or through law or enforceable means), which impose requirements to ensure adequate transparency of &#xA;beneficial ownership. &#xA;&#xA;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information:&lt;/u&gt;&#xA;&#xA;In eForms this indicator is used when the nationality of beneficial owner is not provided because the Economic Operator is registered in a regulated market that is subject to disclosure requirements consistent with Union law or subject to equivalent international standards which ensure adequate transparency of ownership information. &#xA;&#xA;WG Approval 21/11/2019"/>
