				<properties name="Economic Operator" type="Logical" documentation="&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;An Economic Operator is an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;Economic Operators can be Tenderers (the submitter of the Tender) or sub-contractors.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;When the Economic Operators are members of a group (e.g. Consortia, Joint ventures, Undertaking (EO Group Type)), and they play different roles, e.g. group lead entity, member of the group, etc. (EO Role Type).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;The Winner of a contract is a tenderer or group of Tenderers.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;Tenderers may rely on other Economic Operator that are subcontractors but not tenderers.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;When guarantees are required by the Procuring Entity, Economic Operators may have to provide Financial Account details (e.g. a bank account data).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;a href=&quot;$imageman://id=1263871221;mdg=Global;name=Legend.png;type=Bitmap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Legend.png&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt; "/>
