				<properties name="Techniques and Instruments" type="Logical" documentation="&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;Techniques are specific methods of carrying out a purchase. E.g. Framework Agreement, e-Auction or Dynamic Purchase System.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;	&lt;li&gt;Each Technique has its own properties, thus Framework Agreement can be typified, has a duration, its own values, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;a href=&quot;$imageman://id=1263871221;mdg=Global;name=Legend.png;type=Bitmap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Legend.png&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &#xA;"/>
